Normalized DAC81416 REFCMP RC sensitivity model
* Rint=1000 ohm is swept because TI does not publish the internal value.
* This is not a reference-loop stability model.
.options reltol=1e-8 abstol=1e-13 vntol=1e-10 plotwinsize=0
Vdrive src 0 PULSE(0 1 1u 1n 1n 5e-05 0.0001)
Rint src refcmp 1000
Ccomp refcmp 0 3.3e-10
.tran 6.25e-09 2.5e-05
.save time v(refcmp)
.end
